{"speciesId":234,"names":{"fr":"Cerfrousse","es":"Stantler","en":"Stantler","ja":"オドシシ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"The curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where real­ ity is distorted."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Those who stare at its antlers will gradually lose control of their senses and be unable to stand."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The round balls found on the fallen antlers can be ground into a powder that aids in sleeping."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"STANTLER’s magnificent antlers were traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this POKéMON was hunted close to extinction by those who were after the priceless antlers."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"STANTLER’s magnificent antlers were traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this POKéMON was hunted close to extinction by those who were after the priceless antlers."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"STANTLER’s magnificent antlers were once traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this POKéMON was hunted close to extinction."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Those who stare at its antlers will gradually lose control of their senses and be unable to stand."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"The curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Those who stare at its antlers will gradually lose control of their senses and be unable to stand."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quiconque observe ses antennes ressent une sensation étrange, comme si leur centre l’attirait."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quiconque observe ses antennes ressent une sensation étrange, comme si leur centre l’attirait."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quiconque observe ses bois ressent une sensation étrange, comme si leur centre l’attirait."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Mirar a su cornamenta provoca una extraña sensación de pérdida de equilibrio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Staring at its antlers creates an odd sensation as if one were being drawn into their centers."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ツノを 見つめていると 輪っかの 中心に 吸いこまれそうな 不思議な 気分に なってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses bois tordus changent le flot de l’air et créent une distorsion spatiale dans la réalité."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cornamenta cambia el flujo del aire para crear un espacio de realidad distorsionada."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The curved antlers subtly change the flow of air to create a strange space where reality is distorted."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ツノの 曲がり具合が まわりの 空気の 流れを 微妙に 変え 不思議な 空間を 作り出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les superbes bois de Cerfrousse étaient vendus très cher comme œuvres d’art. Ce Pokémon fut chassé et l’espèce proche de l’extinction à cause des gens qui recherchaient leurs précieux bois."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hace tiempo, se comerciaba con la magnífica cornamenta de Stantler. Se vendía como obra de arte a alto precio. Los interesados en cornamentas de valor incalculable empezaron a cazarlos y casi provocan su extinción."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Stantler’s magnificent antlers were traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this Pokémon was hunted close to extinction by those who were after the priceless antlers."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"見事な 形の ツノは 美術品 として 高く 売れた ために 絶滅 寸前まで 乱獲された ことのある ポケモン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les superbes bois de Cerfrousse étaient vendus très cher comme œuvres d’art. Ce Pokémon fut chassé et l’espèce proche de l’extinction à cause des gens qui recherchaient leurs précieux bois."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hace tiempo, se comerciaba con la magnífica cornamenta de Stantler. Se vendía como obra de arte a alto precio. Los interesados en cornamentas de valor incalculable empezaron a cazarlos y casi provocan su extinción."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Stantler’s magnificent antlers were traded at high prices as works of art. As a result, this Pokémon was hunted close to extinction by those who were after the priceless antlers."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"見事な 形の ツノは 美術品 として 高く 売れた ために 絶滅 寸前まで 乱獲された ことのある ポケモン。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Its strangely shaped antlers have the power to bewitch those who see them. Medicine made by grinding up the black orbs from fallen antlers is an effective treatment for insomnia."}],"varieties":[{"id":234,"moves":[{"name":"stomp","learns":